    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a91223466b77ffe37d72fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55fcecbf86a3be076743619e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "送　迎！搭我的车便是！\r\n直到府中的天气都很糟糕哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db7c18aec2364d416d848d8a2113a8f736df6706294c0fa62f122208a678155",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208595a159c3bc97e5387cf1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万万没想到，居然正巧遇上了秋川理事长。\r\n不过……我却感到一股奇妙的因缘。\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a18fe27b6f80f2816285c14a7def3a78862fc7a393b2798153f46bd5d92d0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5cb51b784109c13c0b58cd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一场莫名其妙的台风，以及唐突的救援……\r\n这完全就是数个小概率事件接连发生的结果。\r\n而这一切——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4374c22817285bfece741f742f2b51d89127ad250c8c22d8adf26238c1724268",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:439eeaddabbce7830a5085be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:132e0676aa3a576b863d77d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阻挡牵绊与情谊……\r\n合约的——高墙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8811efd0f8b39e1a10a19b65837780b0d98a2eafb0172582b8b976f1c3a03054",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91ae65f4e5af607380374bc9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……今天所发生的事情，\r\n到底和新宇宙所说的那番话，\r\n有多少联系呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "20caa5558d6a693288036b22b95209aaae283061beba81487b101515f2f71a13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6dfd21fa2afb046537330c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这感觉，简直就是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d38f5b1ab4167ce29e3f3a3fe20cf6382421e64ed5dd6db49461498767b504",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7542fc5fdb838f5d086158f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可不是只用“下雨”这种词来形容的天气。\r\n我们正遭受着一场反季节的台风；\r\n不仅如此——",
      "source_fingerprint": "75af44d8b529491820dfaa43d9d5d96a3b489a285406dc466655565e1a88142c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26635359d65863ed4ee1eec0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，抱歉久等了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcaec7d37775c5abae5d48a22e35446a80c1eef62c2731e2351b4cd3c775f230",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
