      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我心中的勇气却愈发炽热！\r\n但有一息尚存，\r\n我便会在这英雄之路上勇往直前！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a3796a1a6226179dd3d1ab2507cff0718dd36b0545adc19e693aed84c994129",
