    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b78059feec64d0283b37d351",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好的！\r\n请不要手下留情，\r\n尽情一战吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "595173fc8ae286cc3406a301d5b828e3f0f05fe8b0c309a8b558de0a62b97f27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1a9a186fdc1928750ae3b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛临近开幕……\r\n风暴终于停歇，雨势也渐渐变小。不过——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24c4228d0e9f6fae3153e364cab0458f296aa116d048adbe08a87f675caf3bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7c5191ebc2df978c0915da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛道仍然一片狼藉。\r\n二人在这泥泞之上，\r\n究竟能否以奔跑相互沟通呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b791bdbbf1320a9cd68f07d2fb45850fac5e623b8ae59c365a7da8b4cebf9b82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac3bb6d035df33dc58ff26d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要赶不上新宇宙的比赛了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc897f9c7b329da967af3ea7b63f2cdc99a4f54b73fcf624f9349e3c528c57f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b568736c0c014552b7a2ddec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我为了拿一份重要文件而回了一趟学园……但当\r\n我出来时，几乎所有公共交通全部瘫痪。\r\n这样下去的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "80025dd7b6bb1ab741208f1d3cb464b93d80c85352c6657d3a36215ce077e894",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70557bfda847712ad68dff5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "居然会无法在日本德比开赛前与签约赛马娘见\r\n面。\r\n这样堪称训练员失职的事情，闻所未闻……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "738ce4ec7201b9b2677b62b6fc70150036f4678fea4f6b20fe89996ac4a10e64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0822cca7bad74a40e94084c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出租车排队处也是一条长龙。\r\n这样的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b8b4743eb6aa028e334ffdbb2f218bd79c70e58018aeeebbf3f8b961e4eeca8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015c4dd34a10864ecccc9779",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跑去了另一侧的车道，拼命地举起手。\r\n即便最后只能搭便车，\r\n我也必须回到新宇宙身边……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8963c3eb4dcae5864a6ca6bf14f0970254fcf776ad6bde29b80334f4e0fa75b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
