      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为新宇宙……『想要奔跑』。\r\n为了你……\r\n同时，也是为了……与『你』一起奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3143f6a427e9349b14171f4fb40e0a9f0a23313e08735e44bdd53efe2729102f",
